@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Postal Address API Permissioning
	Testing Koroneiki Postal Address API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Automotive |

Scenario: Create postal address attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki postal addresses that are attempted to be created via API by non permissioned users should not be created.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I attempt to create a postal address for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	Then I should not be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street"

Scenario: View postal address attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki postal addresses should not be viewable for non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a postal address for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	Then I should not be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Update postal address attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki postal addresses that are attempted to be updated via API by non permissioned users should not be updated.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a postal address for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	And I attempt to update a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Country               | Canada           |
	| Locality              | Vancouver        |
	| Region                | British Columbia |
	| Type                  | Other            |
	| Mailing               | False            |
	| Postal Code           | V5Y 0C9          |
	| Primary               | False            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 456 Main Street  |
	Then I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	And I should not be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "456 Main Street"
	And I should not be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Remove postal address and view attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki postal addresses should not be viewable for non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a postal address for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	And I attempt to delete a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" as a non permissioned user
	Then I should be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" with the following values
	| Country               | United States   |
	| Locality              | Diamond Bar     |
	| Region                | California      |
	| Type                  | Business        |
	| Mailing               | True            |
	| Postal Code           | 91761           |
	| Primary               | True            |
	| Street Address Line 1 | 123 Fake Street |
	And I should not be able to view a postal address on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the street address "123 Fake Street" as a non permissioned user